{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Restless Dreams&quot;</strong> is a story-driven first-person horror adventure game where you experience the anguish and despair of a protagonist tormented by deep loneliness.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Short but Intense Experience :\u00a0</strong>Complete the game in 1\u20132 hours and witness a thought-provoking narrative with an unforgettable ending. Perfect for players seeking psychological tension and fear.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Homage to the PS2 Era :\u00a0</strong>Intentionally crafted low-polygon characters and environments evoke the unique eeriness of early 2000s horror games. A retro-modern visual experience that blends nostalgia with a fresh, unsettling atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meticulous Psychological Depiction :\u00a0</strong>Original characters come to life through detailed 3D animations, painting a more vivid and nightmarish world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bNo generative AI was used in the development of this game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Goodbye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018210/22744ecbd80062f914fd27dff4a7aeffb3deb801.jpg"},{"name":"Still, I\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018210/8865b517ae70661b539f12506650de9e0d9b1ee8.jpg"},{"name":"Writer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018210/44e591d23c1704c5ac73cd9a280973cf07ca6cfd.jpg"},{"name":"Musician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018210/8cc925c1aa4fffb29d38d3ea4295ea933aaad916.jpg"},{"name":"Painter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018210/30573a22ec3b907002db055a4758571a514bb854.jpg"},{"name"